usage: rebis.p4ra [-h] COMMAND ...

rebis.p4ra — Paraconsistent Kernel & Genetics
Structural type: ⟨𐑦𐑸𐑾𐑹𐑐𐑧𐑲𐑵⊙𐑫𐑳𐑟⟩  O_∞ tier · ⊙ criticality

positional arguments:
  COMMAND        Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    belnap       Test Belnap FOUR operations (T, B, F, N)
    genetics     Show genetic code B4 lattice (64 codons)
    verify       Run B3 Frobenius verification suite
    hadrons      Test hadron Belnap operations (mesons, baryons, tetraquarks,
                 glueballs)
    ligands      Generate ligands from enzyme active site
    sidechain    Analyze sidechain × environment composition
    gene-pipeline
                 Run gene-to-protein translation pipeline
    serpent      Run SerpentRod protein design
    sicpovm      Run SIC-POVM probe on active site
    combinatorial
                 Generate combinatorial ligand library
    heterocycles
                 Generate heterocycle-focused ligand library
    list         List all exported symbols
    info         Show available tools (alias for list)
    help         Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
